      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>No. Unlike the Kindle jailbreak path, Cobalt needs no exploit, no SSH, and no terminal on the device. Installation is one command over USB plus a restart, after which a Cobalt entry appears in Kobo's own home-screen menu.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
